d-Drill-Point-Shelter-Island-NMAI-Smithsoanian.jpg\" alt=\"057011.002-Arrow-and-Drill-Point-Shelter-Island-NMAI-Smithsoanian Projectile Points\" /><noscript><img title=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://nativelongisland.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/057011.002-Arrow-and-Drill-Point-Shelter-Island-NMAI-Smithsoanian.jpg\" alt=\"057011.002-Arrow-and-Drill-Point-Shelter-Island-NMAI-Smithsoanian Projectile Points\" /></noscript></a></p><p><a href=\"#listing/manhansack-aqua-quash-awamock\">Manhansack-aqua-quash-awamock</a></p><p>Arrow and Drill Points, NATIONAL MUSEUM OF THE AMERICAN INDIAN, SMITHSONIAN INSTITUTION (057011.002). PHOTO BY NMAI PHOTO SERVICES.</div></div><div></div><div><div><a href=\"#listing/montaukett\"><img title=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" data-src=\"https://nativelongisland.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/068271.000-Arrow-Points-Montauk-Area-NMAI-Smithsonian.jpg\" alt=\"068271.000-Arrow-Points-Montauk-Area-NMAI-Smithsonian Projectile Points\" /><noscript><img title=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://nativelongisland.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/068271.000-Arrow-Points-Montauk-Area-NMAI-Smithsonian.jpg\" alt=\"068271.000-Arrow-Points-Montauk-Area-NMAI-Smithsonian Projectile Points\" /></noscript></a></p><p><a href=\"#listing/montaukett\">Montaukett</a></p><p>Arrow Points. NATIONAL MUSEUM OF THE AMERICAN INDIAN, SMITHSONIAN INSTITUTION (068271.000). PHOTO BY NMAI PHOTO SERVICES.</div></div><div></div><ol><li> John Strong, The Algonquian Peoples of Long Island from Earliest Times to the 1700s, pp. 37<span>[<a href=\"#identifier_1_1699\">&#8617;</a>]</span></li><li> William A Ritchie's A Typology and Nomenclature For New York Projectile Points, 1961, pp. 15<span>[<a href=\"#identifier_2_1699\">&#8617;</a>]</span></li><li> William A Ritchie's A Typology and Nomenclature For New York Projectile Points, 1961, pp. 39<span>[<a href=\"#identifier_3_1699\">&#8617;</a>]</sp